<title>BELGIUM: Tractebel net profit up 6.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Tractebel net profit up 6.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billion of francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net			 12.09   vs   11.34</p>
<p>    Turnover			 344.3    vs  321.7</p>
<p>    Net div/share (francs)     385	vs  370</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian utility Tractebel is a unit of Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA (SGB), itself a unit of French Cie de Suez.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
